<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>인서울 상위 30개 대학가 웹 크롤링 기반 자취방 안심 진단기</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Chart.js CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Pretendard', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f0f3ff',
                            100: '#e0e7ff',
                            500: '#4f46e5',
                            600: '#4338ca',
                            900: '#1e1b4b',
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; }
        .blueprint-grid {
            background-size: 16px 16px;
            background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
                              linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
        }
        .code-font { font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-slate-50">

    <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 h-14 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                <div class="bg-brand-600 text-white p-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-spider"></i>
                </div>
                <h1 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">웹 크롤링 기반 대학가 자취방 안심 진단기</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium hidden sm:flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-bold">Web Crawler Enabled</span>
                <span>Top 30 인서울 대학</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- AI Warning Banner -->
    <div class="bg-amber-50 border-b border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs py-2 px-4">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 text-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-amber-600 shrink-0"></i>
            <span><strong>주의:</strong> 본 AI 및 웹 크롤링 수집 데이터는 참고용입니다. <strong>100% 신뢰하지 마시고</strong> 계약 전 반드시 현장 확인 및 등기부등본을 검토하세요.</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="flex-1 max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto px-4 py-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Left Panel: Input Form & Crawler Controls -->
        <section class="lg:col-span-4 bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4 h-fit">
            <div class="pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                <h2 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm flex items-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-brand-600 mr-2"></i> 자취방 크롤링 조건 입력
                </h2>
                <span class="text-[11px] bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">1인/2인 맞춤</span>
            </div>

            <form id="housingForm" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); triggerCrawlerAndAnalysis();" class="space-y-3.5 text-xs">
                
                <!-- University Select -->
                <div>
                    <label for="universitySelect" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">대학교 선택</label>
                    <select id="universitySelect" onchange="onUniversityChange()" class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2.5 font-medium text-slate-800 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-600">
                    </select>
                </div>

                <!-- Mandatory Address / Building Name Input -->
                <div>
                    <label for="buildingAddressInput" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">건물명 및 상세 위치 <span class="text-rose-500">*필수</span></label>
                    <input type="text" id="buildingAddressInput" placeholder="예: 신촌역 6번 출구 근처 OO하우스 / 대학동 123 빌라" class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2.5 font-medium text-slate-800 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-600" required>
                </div>

                <!-- Target Occupancy (1 Person vs 2 People) -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">거주 인원 선택</label>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <label class="cursor-pointer border rounded-lg p-2 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-50 border-brand-500 text-brand-600" id="occ1Btn">
                            <input type="radio" name="occupancyType" value="1" checked onchange="toggleOccupancy(1)" class="hidden">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i>
                            <span>1인 가구</span>
                        </label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer border rounded-lg p-2 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-50 border-slate-200 text-slate-600" id="occ2Btn">
                            <input type="radio" name="occupancyType" value="2" onchange="toggleOccupancy(2)" class="hidden">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-group"></i>
                            <span>2인 가구(룸메)</span>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Lease Type Selector -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">계약 유형</label>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <label class="cursor-pointer border rounded-lg p-2 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-50 border-brand-500 text-brand-600" id="leaseMonthlyBtn">
                            <input type="radio" name="leaseType" value="monthly" checked onchange="toggleLeaseType('monthly')" class="hidden">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-day"></i>
                            <span>월세</span>
                        </label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer border rounded-lg p-2 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-50 border-slate-200 text-slate-600" id="leaseJeonseBtn">
                            <input type="radio" name="leaseType" value="jeonse" onchange="toggleLeaseType('jeonse')" class="hidden">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-vault"></i>
                            <span>전세</span>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Room Size Selector & Custom Input -->
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700">전용 면적 (평수 고르기 / 직접 입력)</label>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <select id="pyeongSelect" onchange="handlePyeongSelectChange()" class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2.5 font-bold text-brand-600 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-600">
                            <option value="5">5평 (초소형)</option>
                            <option value="7" selected>7평 (일반 원룸)</option>
                            <option value="9">9평 (1.5룸/넓음)</option>
                            <option value="12">12평 (투룸/거실)</option>
                            <option value="custom">직접 입력...</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="relative">
                            <input type="number" id="pyeongCustomInput" value="7" min="1" max="50" step="0.5" disabled class="w-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2.5 font-bold text-slate-400 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-600 pr-8 transition" placeholder="평수">
                            <span class="absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-xs text-slate-400 font-bold">평</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Costs Input -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 pt-1">
                    <div>
                        <label for="depositInput" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1" id="depositLabel">보증금(만)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="depositInput" value="1000" min="0" step="50" class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2 font-bold text-slate-900">
                    </div>
                    <div id="rentInputContainer">
                        <label for="rentInput" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">월세(만)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="rentInput" value="50" min="0" step="1" class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2 font-bold text-slate-900">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label for="maintInput" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">관리비(만)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="maintInput" value="8" min="0" step="1" class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2 font-bold text-slate-900">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Web Crawler Trigger Button -->
                <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl shadow transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 text-sm mt-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i>
                    <span>웹 크롤링 및 실시간 분석 시작</span>
                </button>
            </form>

            <!-- Python Web Crawler Source Code Accordion -->
            <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 space-y-2">
                <button onclick="toggleCrawlerCodeModal()" class="w-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold p-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span><i class="fa-brands fa-python text-brand-600 mr-1.5"></i> 백엔드 웹 크롤러 Python 코드 보기</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Right Panel: Infographics Dashboard -->
        <section class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-5">

            <!-- Real-time Web Crawling Progress Terminal Log Panel -->
            <div id="crawlerLogPanel" class="bg-slate-950 text-emerald-400 p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-800 space-y-2 text-xs code-font">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-xs">Real-Time Web Crawler Engine</span>
                    </div>
                    <span id="crawlStatusBadge" class="text-[10px] bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Ready</span>
                </div>
                <div id="crawlerLogText" class="h-20 overflow-y-auto space-y-1 text-[11px] text-slate-300">
                    <p class="text-slate-500">> 크롤러 엔진 대기 중... 대학교 및 건물명을 입력하고 크롤링을 시작하세요.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-md space-y-4">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-sm flex items-center text-slate-100">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shapes text-amber-400 mr-2 text-base"></i> 크롤링 데이터 한눈 요약 리포트
                    </h3>
                    <span class="text-[10px] bg-brand-500/30 text-brand-300 border border-brand-400/30 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-mono" id="targetBuildingDisplay">미지정 건물</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                    <!-- Graphic Summary Item 1: Room Space & Occupancy Fit -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/90 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/70 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium">📐 공간 크기 & 거주 적합도</span>
                                <span class="text-xs bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold" id="spaceTag">표준</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="font-bold text-amber-300 text-base" id="summarySpaceGrade">7평 (23.1㎡)</div>
                            <div class="w-full bg-slate-700 rounded-full h-2 my-2 overflow-hidden">
                                <div id="spaceProgressBar" class="bg-amber-400 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 45%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-300 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-lg mt-1" id="spaceGraphicLabel">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-users text-amber-400 shrink-0"></i>
                            <span id="summarySpaceDesc">1인 가구 추천 배치</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Graphic Summary Item 2: Cost & Occupancy Split -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/90 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/70 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium">💰 주거 비용 적정성</span>
                                <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-400/20 text-emerald-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold" id="priceTag">적정</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-base" id="summaryPriceGrade">월 58만원</div>
                            <div class="w-full bg-slate-700 rounded-full h-2 my-2 overflow-hidden">
                                <div id="priceProgressBar" class="bg-emerald-400 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 50%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-300 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-lg mt-1">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator text-emerald-400 shrink-0"></i>
                            <span id="summaryPriceDesc">대학가 평균 시세 수준</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Graphic Summary Item 3: Safety Gauge & Recency Period -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/90 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/70 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium">🛡️ 치안/안심 지수 & 데이터 기간</span>
                                <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-400/20 text-indigo-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold" id="safetyTag">안심</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="font-bold text-indigo-300 text-base flex items-baseline justify-between">
                                <span id="summarySafetyGrade">82점</span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] font-normal text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-950/80 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-800/60" id="safetyRecencyBadge">최근 12개월 (2025~2026)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full bg-slate-700 rounded-full h-2 my-2 overflow-hidden">
                                <div id="safetyProgressBar" class="bg-indigo-400 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 82%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-300 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-lg mt-1">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left text-indigo-400 shrink-0"></i>
                            <span id="summarySafetyDesc" class="truncate">최근 1년 치안 유지 우수 지역</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-vector-square text-brand-600 mr-2 text-base"></i> [시각 진단 1] 평수 및 거주 인원(1인/2인) 체감 도면
                    </h3>
                    <span class="text-xs bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-bold" id="detailPyeongHeader">7평 (23.1㎡)</span>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-center">
                    <!-- Floor Plan Visual Blueprint Graphic Box -->
                    <div class="md:col-span-7 bg-slate-900 rounded-xl p-4 blueprint-grid border-2 border-indigo-500/30 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[200px] relative overflow-hidden" id="blueprintBox">
                        <div class="absolute top-2 left-2 bg-indigo-950/80 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-700/50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono" id="blueprintDimText">
                            📐 약 3.8m × 6.0m (23.1㎡)
                        </div>

                        <div class="w-full h-full flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 p-4 pt-6" id="blueprintFurnitureGrid">
                        </div>

                        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-2 text-center bg-slate-950/80 px-2 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-800" id="occupancyNoteText">
                            💡 1인 가구 실거주에 적합한 공간 구성입니다.
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Visual Furniture & Capacity Badges -->
                    <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1 flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-couch text-brand-600 mr-1.5"></i> 수용 가능한 가구 및 시설</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-brand-600 font-bold" id="occupancyBadgeHeader">1인 가구 추천</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1.5 text-xs" id="furnitureBadgeList">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pyeong Catalogue Comparison -->
                <div>
                    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2.5 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-border-all text-brand-600 mr-1.5"></i> 대학가 주변 평형별 그래픽 카탈로그</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-brand-600 font-semibold" id="selectedUnivNameDisplay">서울대학교 주변 기준</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-2.5 text-center text-xs">
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition" id="p5Card">
                            <div class="text-2xl mb-1 text-slate-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-door-closed"></i></div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500">5평 이하</div>
                            <div class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-0.5" id="p5Rent">월 38만</div>
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1 bg-white rounded py-0.5 border border-slate-100">초소형 · 1인전용</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition" id="p7Card">
                            <div class="text-2xl mb-1 text-brand-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-bed"></i></div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-600">6~8평</div>
                            <div class="font-extrabold text-brand-600 mt-0.5" id="p7Rent">월 45만</div>
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-600/80 mt-1 bg-brand-50 rounded py-0.5 border border-brand-100 font-bold">표준 원룸 · 1인추천</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition" id="p10Card">
                            <div class="text-2xl mb-1 text-indigo-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-couch"></i></div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500">9~11평</div>
                            <div class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-0.5" id="p10Rent">월 60만</div>
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1 bg-white rounded py-0.5 border border-slate-100">넓은원룸 · 2인가능</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 transition" id="p15Card">
                            <div class="text-2xl mb-1 text-emerald-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-people-roof"></i></div>
                            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500">12평 이상</div>
                            <div class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-0.5" id="p15Rent">월 85만</div>
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1 bg-white rounded py-0.5 border border-slate-100">투룸 · 2인강추</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="bg-white p-4.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-800 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple text-brand-600 mr-1.5"></i> [시각 진단 2] 비용 지출 vs 시세 비교
                        </h3>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">단위: 만원</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-44 relative">
                        <canvas id="priceComparisonChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Safety Gauge with Explicit Recency Period Information -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2">
